{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/extras/b464819fba624c8dcda0dd31a4ea12c0.avif?t=1752109850\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;AQK&quot; is a job interview simulation game where you, a job seeker, face off against a series of eccentric interviewers in pursuit of that coveted job offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you\u2019ll face off against a cast of quirky interviewers who seem to have made it their mission to ask the most mind-bending questions possible..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core gameplay involves answering interview questions within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, as time passes, your available response options may decrease\u2014or even increase\u2014depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the interviewers\u2019 reactions may change based on your timing and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you answer\u2014and when you answer\u2014will be the key to landing the job.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636390?t=1752109850","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3636390?t=1752109850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/6133aa200a4cbece6c0cbe5668b7ff0dbe77e3b7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752109850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/6133aa200a4cbece6c0cbe5668b7ff0dbe77e3b7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752109850","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/extras/b464819fba624c8dcda0dd31a4ea12c0.avif?t=1752109850\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;AQK&quot; is a job interview simulation game where you, a job seeker, face off against a series of eccentric interviewers in pursuit of that coveted job offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you\u2019ll face off against a cast of quirky interviewers who seem to have made it their mission to ask the most mind-bending questions possible..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core gameplay involves answering interview questions within a time limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">However, as time passes, your available response options may decrease\u2014or even increase\u2014depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, the interviewers\u2019 reactions may change based on your timing and choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How you answer\u2014and when you answer\u2014will be the key to landing the job.</p>","developers":["Asroni Inc"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3636390/92a5087327ec48d32835d16aa05b8c7368e43823/header.jpg?t=1752109850","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257163700,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257163700/movie480.mp4?t=1752106666","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2571